{"ID":"20260206210535-irk1xp6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-irk1xp6","title":"如何解决 OpenClaw “Pairing required” 报错：两种官方解决方案详解","type":"doc","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210535-2e3osms","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-2e3osms","updated":"20260206210535"}},{"ID":"20260206210535-h8wtfxd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-h8wtfxd","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210535-hnbizz3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-hnbizz3","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210535-nt09or9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-nt09or9","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何解决 OpenClaw “Pairing required” 报错：两种官方解决方案详解"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210535-gvi7cz6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-gvi7cz6","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210535-gt067gv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-gt067gv","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://blog.csdn.net/qq_44866828/article/details/157803972?spm=1000.2115.3001.10524","TextMarkTextContent":"https://blog.csdn.net/qq_44866828/article/details/157803972?spm=1000.2115.3001.10524"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210535-xhaha3q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-xhaha3q","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210535-alhrxx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-alhrxx2","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文章浏览阅读1.6k次，点赞3次，收藏3次。摘要：OpenClaw 网关的 \"Pairing required\" 错误是安全机制触发的正常现象，要求首次连接设备必须经过管理员授权。本文提供两种解决方案：1）生产环境推荐使用命令行审批（openclaw devices approve），通过设备ID显式授权；2）开发测试可用配置文件修改法，在pending.json中设置silent:true实现自动批准。两种方案各具特点，前者安全性高适合生产，后者便捷性强适合本地开发。文末还包含常见故障排查和安全加固建议，帮助用户平衡安全与便利性"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210535-q4p2c2f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-q4p2c2f","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210535-xpdbxgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-xpdbxgq","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2026-02-06 21:05"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210535-z4k7tor","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-z4k7tor","updated":"20260206210535"}},{"ID":"20260206210535-1gtozov","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-1gtozov","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何解决 OpenClaw “Pairing required” 报错：两种官方解决方案详解"}]},{"ID":"20260206210535-wyfbeiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-wyfbeiu","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-ca5e3180a11b41caac00e5220bf477a8-20260206210536-pp2ozn1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"                                                                                      西安城市开发者社区                              文章已被社区收录"}]},{"ID":"20260206210535-7gmf4jb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-7gmf4jb","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkTextContent":"加入社区"}]},{"ID":"20260206210535-j4tk21m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210535-j4tk21m","updated":"20260206210535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBrack